1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,320
Now slide the oxygen one place along.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,549
Two carbons on each side: ethoxyethane.

3
00:00:06,549 --> 00:00:12,942
Same formula, same functional group, but the carbons are shared out differently around the oxygen.

4
00:00:12,942 --> 00:00:14,882
Those two are metamers.

